      {
        "kind": "instructionNode",
        "name": "initialize",
        "docs": [
          "Create the vector account for a key at [\"vector\", [scheme], sha256(key)].",
          "An instruction can allocate 10,240 bytes, so a bigger account (ML-DSA-44) takes more calls: each later call carries no scheme or key, grows the account and fills in the rest from the stored key."
        ],
        "optionalAccountStrategy": "programId",
